        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSPA4040, 4\" x 4\" Parliament Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n4\" by 4\" Residential Parliament Hinge. 0.157\" thick. Tooled for a tight knuckle action. A parliament hinge is a butt hinge where the knuckle protrudes from the door so that the door when fully opened stands away from the wall. Designed for doors that need to swing 180° and clear a projection such as a decorative molding around the door frame. It is often used on windows and shutters because this type of hinge allow them to swing past deep trim work. A solid brass hinge, it is available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a set of two hinges and wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSPA4040-specifications.gif?v=1704354779\" width=\"379\" height=\"417\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSPA4040 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Parliament Hinge 4\" x 4\":\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness (gauge): 0.157\"</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1-1/4\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Extruded</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSPA4040.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSPA4040 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 x 4 Solid Brass Parliament Hinge, Pair, Deltana DSPA4040",
                "description": "Deltana DSPA4040 4 inch x 4 inch Parliament Hinge Pair - 4 inch by 4 inch Residential Parliament Hinge. 0.157 inches thick. Tooled for a tight knuckle action. A parliament hinge is a butt hinge where the knuckle protrudes from the door so that the door when fully opened stands away from the wall. Designed for doors that need to swing 180 degrees and clear a projection such as a decorative molding around the door frame. It is often used on windows and shutters because this type of hinge allow them to swing past deep trim work. A solid brass hinge, it is available in 8 finishes.",
